        "mission_intent": "We need a comprehensive internal control specification for our agency's use of the third-party payroll processing service provided by ADP Federal. Per OMB Circular A-123 guidance on management's responsibility when outsourcing to service organizations, please develop a full user agency control framework that addresses the following: First, define all input/output controls our payroll team must perform, including reconciliation procedures where data submitted to ADP is compared against reports and processed outputs received back, with specific checkpoints for each pay cycle. Second, establish a performance monitoring protocol tied to our existing service-level agreement with ADP, covering timeliness of processing, accuracy rates, system availability, and incident response metrics. Third, document how management retains overall accountability for the end-to-end payroll process even though key processing steps are performed externally, including escalation paths and quarterly attestation requirements. The specification should make clear that the agency cannot delegate its fundamental responsibility for internal controls to the service organization and must treat monitoring as a continuous obligation. Please coordinate with the CFO's office and HR shared services, and have the draft framework ready for senior management review by the end of next month.",
